            "review_title": "Review at Dong Duong Restaurant (indochine)",
            "review_text": "SAB5859\nBanff, United Kingdom4551 contributions\n0\nWhat a Fantastic Restaurant\nMar 2019 • Couples\nWe visited this restaurant for lunch while on a bus tour of Ho Chi Minh City.\nThere were several bus tours from our cruise ship having lunch at this restaurant.\nThe food was just fantastic and we ranked it as the best meal we have had on any of cruise ship tours we have been on so far.\nThe staff were really well organised and served the many different courses up like a well oiled machine.\nThe staff were very pleasant and helpful.\nThe restaurant and toilets were spotless clean.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 15, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
