            "review_text": "lchilcoat2000\nDa Lat, Vietnam674 contributions\n0\nVery disappointing\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nWe have eaten here before and\nWe\nLiked \n\nNow the restaurant has changed to ordering from an iPad device which is not user friendly in my opinion. Beautiful place and wonderful decor. \n\nDishes we\nOrdered one appetiser was greasy , one\nMain Entree the noodles were dry and the calamari was tough and chewy. \n\nSpring rolls were tasty though . \n\nHad one beer and one strawberry type drink non alcohol \n\n800,000 + VND and I have to say my self and my date we’re not impressed. \n\nTheir are other choices in the area which are better in my opinion.\nRead more\nWritten February 23, 2019",
